PRIVATE REFLECTION: {
Unanimous consensus is firmly established across all participants that the Cortex Bladewing is the sole flying unit from a Tier 1 building in Beyond All Reason capable of shooting and stunning enemy targets. It is produced directly from the Cortex Tier 1 Aircraft Plant and uses a paralyzer beam to inflict non-lethal EMP stun. Alternative options such as the Armada Stiletto and Dragonfly remain definitively ruled out due to tier restrictions and cross-game naming overlap. Final round strategy is to lock in the Cortex Bladewing as the definitive answer.
}

